error[addlogprob]: `@addlogprob!` adds density term outside `~`
 --> positive.jl:4:5
  |
4 |     @addlogprob! sum(logpdf.(Laplace(0, σ), x))
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ term has no variable
  |
  = why: `Prior()` sampling, `rand`, `predict` and pointwise likelihoods skip or misfile it
  = fix: state term with `~`; for new density, define `Distribution` subtype with `logpdf` and `rand`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain addlogprob
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow addlogprob -- <reason>`

